OL,3,GNEWSASchool attendance drops across
OL,4,AScotland after bomb hoax
OL,5,
OL,6,FAttendance at schools across the
OL,7,Fcountry has dropped following bomb
OL,8,Fthreats - despite Police Scotland
OL,9,Fconfirming they were a hoax.
OL,11,FParents have posted online that their
OL,12,Fchildren were still too worried to
OL,13,Freturn to to the classroom and several
OL,14,Fcouncils have confirmed that absence
OL,15,Frates were much higher than usual on
OL,16,FTuesday.
OL,18,FGlasgow City Council said that some of
OL,19,Ftheir schools had 50% fewer pupils than
OL,20,Fnormal.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
