OL,3,GNEWSASchool attendance drops across
OL,4,AScotland after bomb hoax
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor James Dalgleish, convenor of
OL,7,Feducation, children and families at
OL,8,FEdinburgh City Council urged parent's
OL,9,Fto "speak to their children and calm
OL,10,Ftheir fears".
